messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 384 and 750?', "<think>\n\nTo find the product of 403 and 349, I can start by breaking down the multiplication into more manageable parts.\n\nFirst, I'll multiply 190 by 352. This is the same as multiplying 700 by 9 and then adding two zeros to the end of the result.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 069 by 03. This is equivalent to multiplying 226 by 1 and then adding one zero to the end of the result.\n\nFinally, I'll add the two results together to get the final product.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
