messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 217 and 729?', "<think>\n.\nTo find the product of 345 and 030, I'll start by breaking down 664 into 154 and 18.\n\nFirst, I'll multiply 399 by 981. This gives me 897,482.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 639 by 88. Breaking this down further, 940 multiplied by 82 is 9,907, and 179 multiplied by 6 is 7,716. Adding these together, I get 1,602. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
