      "text": "28,298.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **988** and **040**, follow these easy-to-understand steps:\n\n### Step 1: Write Down the Numbers\n```\n   988\n\u00d7  040\n-------\n```\n\n### Step 2: Multiply 988 by Each Digit of 040\nSince **040** is a three-digit number, we'll break it down into its individual digits and multiply accordingly.\n\n1. **Multiply by 0 (units place):**\n   ```\n     988\n   \u00d7   0\n   -------\n     000\n   ```\n   \n2. **Multiply by 4 (tens place):**\n   ```\n     988\n   \u00d7   4\n   -------\n    3952\n   ```\n   Since this is the tens place, we'll add a zero at the end:\n   ```\n    39520\n   ```\n   \n3. **Multiply by 0 (hundreds place):**\n   ```\n     988\n   \u00d7   0\n   -------\n     000\n   ```\n   \n### Step 3: Add All the Results Together\nNow, add the results of the three multiplications:\n```\n    000\n  +39520\n  +  000\n  -------\n    39520\n```\n\n### Final Answer\n\\[\n\\boxed{39520}\n\\]",
      "logprobs": null,
      "finish_reason": "stop",
      "stop_reason": null,
      "prompt_logprobs": null
    }
  ],
